  "サム: はじめまして=nice to meet you|。|サム=Sam|^と=(as)|申{もう}します=am called (humble)|。|お邪魔{じゃま}させていただきます=thank you for having me|。 >> Nice to meet you. My name is Sam. Thank you for having me.",
